00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:11.990
Sir Spartokos...

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:12.980
Lady Mitchie...

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:15.160
I have nothing left to teach you.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:16.660
Fare thee well.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:16.660
..Lady Mitchie...

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.700
S-Sir Peter...?

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:35.020
For some strange reason,

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:38.120
I feel as though a burden
has been lifted from my shoulders.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.240
Yup, you're a changed man.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:43.230
Totally different from the person you were yesterday.

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.890
And that power coursing through your veins—

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:49.450
It should be more than enough to defeat Lisa Alpacas!

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:50.820
C'mon!

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:53.470
Let's go request another rematch right now!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.700
Sir Peter...

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:57.850
I must admit, it was exactly as you said.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.820
By pouring my time and effort 
into the pursuit of a particular woman,

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:04.250
I had lost sight of the path to true happiness.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:05.340
<i>What...?</i>

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:07.560
Tokos!

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.400
Oh, Mitchie!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.550
Here, you forgot your lunch!

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:13.780
How thoughtful of you!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.520
Eat this, and tonight you'll have 
more muscles, muscles!

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:18.140
Muscles, muscles!

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:19.770
Uh, hello...?

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.390
What about your rematch with Lisa?

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.680
Oh, Lady Lisa?

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:24.020
Yeah, Lisa!

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:27.680
That's all water under the bridge now.

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:32.590
Hey Tokos, you should join our Guild, too!

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:32.590
<i>God dammit!</i>

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.270
I suppose so...

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:35.360
<i>The guy gave up as soon as he got a girlfriend!</i>

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:40.240
I could've sworn everything was
...going according to plan...

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:42.100
What a relief...

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:45.300
It would appear that he's finally found a suitable partner.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:46.130
Lisa?!

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:48.450
Muscles!

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:51.800
Despite his sentimental nature,
that man is the best our army has to offer.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:49.560
Muscles?

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.010
Muscles, muscles!

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:51.800
Muscles!

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:53.580
He's a top-notch soldier and a capable leader.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:58.470
I expect that this situation will dispel
any doubts and encourage success.

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:03.410
I owe you a debt of gratitude for your
assistance with this matter, Peter Grill.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.540
"The path to happiness."

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.150
I couldn't have said it better myself.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:13.440
Have you considered giving any thought to it?

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:14.020
Huh?

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:17.530
What does "true happiness" mean to you?

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:24.490
Marrying that naïve, oblivious Luvellia?

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:28.500
Getting stuck with that senile old
Albatross as your father-in-law?

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:29.930
Be honest.

00:08:29.930 --> 00:08:32.720
Is that what you'd call "true happiness"?

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:33.970
W-Well, I...

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:37.820
If you were serious about our relationship,

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:41.720
there's a possibility that you could become 
the king of an entire nation.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.100
<i>What'd she just say?!</i>

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:46.860
Think it over carefully.

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:50.030
Which path is it you seek?

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:52.360
Where does your true happiness lie?

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:58.500
<i>"True happiness"...</i>

00:08:58.500 --> 00:08:59.160
Peter-kun!

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.190
<i>That's right...</i>

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:12.920
<i>I already told myself that I'm done being indecisive!</i>

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.100
Peter-kun!

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:17.100
Luvellia-senpai!

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:19.470
<i>My mind is made up.</i>

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:22.930
<i>I know that this is my path to happiness!</i>

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:24.310
Peter-kun!

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:25.640
Luvellia-senpai!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:27.520
Where have you been?!

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:29.060
Please, you have to come with me!

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:30.350
It's the Goblins!

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.070
Huh?

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:32.320
N-No way—!

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:35.480
The Goblin Invasion is finally upon us!

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:40.940
<i>A feeding frenzy of despicable creatures called
Goblins who devour every man in sight!</i>

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:46.630
We've already received numerous requests
for backup from villages across the area!

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:48.850
A mass outbreak of Goblins—

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:51.920
If we don't nip this in the bud,
the effects could be catastrophic.

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:54.040
I just hope we make it in time...

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:58.180
<i>Look out, Luvellia-senpai!</i>

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:02.680
<i>I wouldn't mind going on a trip together
outside of our Guild duties.</i>

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.650
<i>Just the two of us...</i>

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:07.380
I'll protect you!

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:11.730
No matter what happens, I'll keep you safe!

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:14.690
Same here. I have faith in you!

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.630
When this mission is over, it's just you and me.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.070
I can't wait to go on vacation together!

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:24.110
Agape!

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:26.300
Meet Agape Jr.!

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:27.530
91 points!

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:29.580
What is this, amateur hour?!

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:30.780
I knew it.

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:33.800
A woman admired by Sir Peter 
is not to be trifled with!

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:34.790
Don't be silly.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.380
Our record still stands at over 100 points!

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:41.840
Losing to Albatross' foolish daughter is <i>not</i> an option!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:46.510
Peter Grill, regardless of which
...path you choose to take...

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:52.420
Those precious juices of yours belong to me!

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:56.150
It started out as a simple crush

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:59.200
Suddenly, you were my biggest source of strength

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:01.820
Till death do us part, let's grow old together

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:05.080
This is my sincerest wish:

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.160
Stay with me, stay with me

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:10.830
So long time, by my side for all eternity

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:14.040
Beaten down by our daily struggles

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:16.460
Or soaked by a storm of rage;

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:19.420
If you get drenched, I won't hesitate

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:21.800
To be the umbrella that shields you

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:24.510
It's not so cold... I'm by your side

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:26.970
That's good enough for me

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:30.140
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:34.020
That smile of yours puts my soul at ease

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:36.440
I could search the whole world over

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.530
And find no one like you

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:41.530
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:45.490
Just the sight of you fills my heart with joy

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:47.700
No matter how much it may hurt,

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:50.750
I pledge my life to protecting you

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:56.360
<i>Dear Sir Peter Grill...</i>

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:02.530
An Elite Squad of Hobgoblins
"The Three Stars of Hell"

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:03.150
Looks like it's our turn next!

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.100
Wait for me...

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.520
Big brother.
